    <summary>Native Windows Network Latency and Multi-Host Diagnostic Software</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
PingKmon is a high-performance network diagnostic and latency monitoring tool built specifically for Windows. Whether diagnosing packet loss spikes, troubleshooting routing bottlenecks, or verifying connection stability, PingKmon delivers real-time telemetry with a minimal system footprint.

Features:
- Multi-Host Concurrent Monitoring: Track latency, jitter, and packet loss across multiple servers, DNS endpoints, and gateways simultaneously.
- Real-Time Visual Timelines: High-frequency interactive canvas charts rendering smooth latency histories.
- Visual Traceroute and Path Analysis: Hop-by-hop route diagnostics identifying exact peering bottlenecks.
- Integrated Speed Test: Test download/upload throughput and loaded latency directly inside the app.
- Smart Audio and Threshold Alerts: Customizable audio alarms and visual indicators.
- Native Windows Integration: Built-in system tray minimization, auto-startup, and silent delta updates.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/the-arizul/PingKmon/releases/tag/v2.1.1</releaseNotes>
